# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env*` is gitignored — never commit real secrets.
# These are validated at boot by `lib/env.ts`; the app refuses to start if any is
# missing or invalid. Set the same vars per-environment in Vercel Project Settings.

# Access-gate stopgap (V0-4): shared household code that gates the preview/prod URL
# until Clerk household login lands (v1.5). Minimum 8 characters. This is a
# deterrent, NOT an authorization boundary — real authz lives in the DAL.
ACCESS_GATE_PASSWORD="change-me-to-a-long-random-code"
